@startuml
title T12-WF04 — AI CRM Follow-up Agent (Sequence)
autonumber
participant "NestJS Scheduler/Domain Service" as SCHED
participant "RabbitMQ" as MQ
participant "n8n WF04\nFollow-up" as N8N
participant "NestJS Backend" as API
database "PostgreSQL" as DB
participant "Communication API" as COMM
participant "Email/Message Provider" as PROVIDER

SCHED -> DB: Select due follow-up execution
SCHED -> MQ: Publish lead.follow_up.triggered(eventId, executionId [required target field])
MQ -> N8N: Deliver due execution event (target payload includes executionId)
activate N8N
N8N -> N8N: Validate event, IDs and idempotency key
N8N -> API: GET enrollment/lead/step context
API -> DB: Read execution state
DB --> API: Enrollment, step, due time, status
API --> N8N: Authoritative follow-up context
N8N -> N8N: Check eligibility and render approved template
alt Enrollment inactive, not due, or duplicate
N8N -> API: Record ignored/not-eligible result
API -> DB: Record idempotent outcome/audit
API --> N8N: No send; execution closed or ignored
else Eligible execution
N8N -> COMM: POST send message request through NestJS
COMM -> COMM: Validate permission, template and delivery idempotency
COMM -> PROVIDER: Send email/message
PROVIDER --> COMM: Delivered / retryable error / permanent error
COMM --> N8N: Normalized delivery result
N8N -> API: POST execution callback with result and correlation IDs
API -> DB: Persist delivery status
DB --> API: Status persisted
API --> N8N: Callback accepted
alt Delivery succeeded
N8N -> API: Advance step or complete enrollment
API -> DB: Update enrollment and next step transactionally
DB --> API: Updated state
API --> N8N: Advanced/completed
else Retryable failure
N8N -> API: Schedule idempotent retry
API -> DB: Record retry attempt and next due time
DB --> API: Retry scheduled
API --> N8N: Retry scheduled; do not advance
else Permanent failure
N8N -> API: Record terminal failure / create owner task
API -> DB: Persist terminal failure
API --> N8N: Failed; do not advance
end
end
deactivate N8N
note over N8N,COMM
n8n never sends SMTP directly. NestJS exposes and enforces the canonical operations shown in this sequence; the Communication API owns delivery and policy checks.
end note
@enduml
